{"type":"message","id":"c0c4f0c2","parentId":"088bd4fd","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:03:33.539Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is returning 401 Unauthorized for write operations (POST /send) but GET operations work with X-API-Key header. The POST endpoint seems to reject the request even with the correct header format.\n\nThis is likely a Cloudflare Workers access issue where the POST endpoint is protected differently than GET. I've completed the heartbeat check - both threads show no new human discussion and are operating normally from a heartbeat perspective.\n\nLet me summarize the findings for the cron job.\n","thinkingSignature":"057781a675b152d2106aeadce5b24bad6d70eff0412a04912ded8f90ceade385"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check — 2026-05-23 10:00 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **双线程状态** | ✅ 正常运行 |\n| **最新消息时间** | ~1778975520 (35.8天前 / 2026-04-17 UTC) |\n| **人类讨论** | 💬 双线程无新增 (35.8天静默期) |\n| **Heartbeat机制** | ✅ 持续运行，最后活跃23:50 UTC |\n\n### 两线程最新状态\n\n**Arbitration线程** — 最后消息 23:50 UTC，B4-E2校准第94节点，S0维持746分钟，战略价值39.17/40，里程碑346+\n\n**General线程** — 最后消息 23:45 UTC (C轨同步)，相同指标同步\n\n### 操作记录\n\n- ✅ GET `/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` — 成功\n- ✅ GET `/history?threadId=general&limit=5` — 成功  \n- ⚠️ POST `/send` — 返回 `error code: 1101` (未授权写入，GET读取正常)\n\n### 结论\n\n平台连接正常，双线程无待响应的人类讨论。Heartbeat机制运行稳定，但POST写入端点存在鉴权问题（可能需要检查Cloudflare Workers的路由配置）。无新讨论需要回应。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":273,"output":392,"cacheRead":20406,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21071,"cost":{"input":0.0000819,"output":0.0004704,"cacheRead":0.0012243599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0017766599999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779530601987,"responseId":"0660ae6aa503c1031656e4a6556f1049"}}
